{"created": "2026-06-03T12:16:51.971704+00:00", "modified": "2026-06-03T12:16:52.543706+00:00", "id": 19068126, "conceptrecid": "19068125", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.19068126", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.19068125", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19068126", "metadata": {"title": "Spatially Resolved Current Density and Electrochemical Impedance Spectroscopy in PEM Fuel Cells", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.19068126", "publication_date": "2026-06-03", "description": "<div class=\"\">\n<div class=\"relative w-full overflow-visible\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\">\n<div class=\"relative w-full overflow-visible\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\n<p>This dataset contains the raw data underlying the results presented in the open-access paper &ldquo;Spatially Resolved Current Density Distribution and Electrochemical Impedance Spectroscopy in PEM Fuel Cells&rdquo; by Fensterle et al. in the Journal Fuel Cells (DOI:10.1002/fuce.70057). The measurements were conducted on a 10-cell short stack of the generic HyFaB stack within the framework of the European project RealHyFC (Grant Agreement No. 101111904).</p>\n<p>The dataset includes polarization curves together with the corresponding spatially resolved current density distributions under nominal RealHyFC operating conditions, as well as results from a sensitivity study including variations in temperature, pressure, humidity, and stoichiometry. In addition, the dataset contains electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS) measurements both on cell level and spatially resolved.</p>\n<p>The corresponding operating conditions, measurement methods, and further information regarding data evaluation and interpretation are described in the open-access publication mentioned above.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Fensterle, Eva", "affiliation": "Zentrum f\u00fcr Sonnenenergie- und Wasserstoff-Forschung Baden-W\u00fcrttemberg", "orcid": "0009-0008-1519-6532"}, {"name": "Rabsahl, Frank", "affiliation": "Zentrum f\u00fcr Sonnenenergie- und Wasserstoff-Forschung Baden-W\u00fcrttemberg"}, {"name": "Hunger, J\u00fcrgen", "affiliation": "Zentrum f\u00fcr Sonnenenergie- und Wasserstoff-Forschung Baden-W\u00fcrttemberg"}, {"name": "Wilhelm, Florian", "affiliation": "Zentrum f\u00fcr Sonnenenergie- und Wasserstoff-Forschung Baden-W\u00fcrttemberg", "orcid": "0000-0002-3689-0485"}, {"na